T*
(- supp_figure6: model fits and model-state plots using the parameter JSON files stored with Table 3.) Tj
T*
(- supp_figure8: explicit-buffer simulations and Biophys SMC inference on simulated pyramidal-like) Tj
T*
(  and interneuron-like cells. Run with run_supp_figure8_code; the script uses compact processed CSV) Tj
T*
(  exports for the plotted trajectories and posterior spike summaries.) Tj
